                  Authored by <strong class="text-optic-disc-gold font-semibold">Krishnendu Mitra</strong> under the
                  advisory mentorship of <strong class="text-text-primary font-semibold">Prof. Soumen
                    Mukherjee</strong>. Open-source inference checkpoints available for ophthalmic researchers.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 shrink-0">
              <a class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest hover:bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface border border-border-subtle font-label-md text-label-md transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"
